>      |                 |                     |condition.Conversely, a 0 here         |
>      |                 |                     |requires a '0' from the comparator     |
>      |-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
>      |                 |                     |When '1' the output from Priority_n    |
>      |                 |                     |OR logic will be actively              |
